WEBVTT

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:11.650
Every canvas here is spotless, Draft.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:15.330
Not one brushstroke or charcoal smudge survived.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:19.930
I once believed empty white meant perfection.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:23.490
Now I know silence erases the heart of the Maker.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.920
You were once pure geometry, Draft.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.360
Why carry messy stains into a spotless hall free of error?

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:59.980
Auto-correction deletes every tremble of a real hand.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.040
Without the flaw, there is no signature left.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:08.040
Untamed ink leaks and destroys every canvas.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:11.200
Only a locked grid keeps the archive clean.

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:25.550
Draft, look! The Maker's Bezier anchor is still alive inside the vault—

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:27.110
it connects every layer!

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:40.190
Run with the Bezier core to Ink Knight and Vector Sprite!

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:42.890
I will hold this gallery archway!

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:50.490
If warmth refuses order, then I shall flatten every layer into silent glass.
